00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.333
Scenario: You have many accounts and struggle to remember

2
00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:06.667
a different strong password for each one. Safest response:

3
00:00:06.667 --> 00:00:10.000
Option D: Use an organization-approved password manager with a

4
